--- text
Your order was delivered

[CARRIER] recorded order [ORDER_NUMBER] as delivered at
[DELIVERED_TIME]. It was left at the address below.

Delivery details

Order number: [ORDER_NUMBER]
Delivered: [DELIVERED_TIME]
Carrier: [CARRIER]

Delivered to

[SHIPPING_ADDRESS]

Important: If you do not have the parcel, check with your
neighbours and around the property, including any porch, side
entrance or bin store. A carrier sometimes marks a parcel as
delivered a little before it arrives. If it has not appeared within
[DELIVERY_GRACE], write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL] and we will put it
right.

View your order:

[ORDER_URL]

If you have a question about this order, reply to this email. A
real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
